Hi,<br><br>I ran some quick SSE tests with a naive c++ implementation, some intrisics on simple float arrays and the sony library. It appears that the prefetch and the cache have a huge impact on the performance. For example, my compiler seems to manage cache optimization on the naive c++ implementation which give better performances than Vectormath::Aos. <br><br>Is there any plans to add prefetch call to the library ?<br><br>Thanks.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8801">kiwilex</a> — Thu Oct 06, 2011 8:34 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
